  "functions": [
    {
      "id": "HELIXSECURITY-L5-001-validate_boundary_input",
      "symbol": "validate_boundary_input",
      "signature": "validate_boundary_input(input: RawValue, context: RawValue, function: F01|F02) -> ValidationResult",
      "requirement_refs": [
        "HELIXSECURITY-L3-001-F01",
        "HELIXSECURITY-L3-001-F02"
      ],
      "effect": "none",
      "algorithm": [
        "input/contextは別引数。入口全record/配列を検査し、閉じた論理recordのunknown propertyと不正型を全所在にinput_invalid/context_invalidで返す。optional_preserve_absenceは欠落を保持し、列挙nullable型以外のnullは不正。RawJSON内部にrecord制約を適用しない。",
        "検査失敗はValidationResult shape=invalid, input_ref/context_ref=null, sorted findings。成功はshape=validでimmutable input/contextの原参照を返す。F01/F02がinvalidをmaterial=nullのComparisonResultへ包む。原bytes/存在差を変更せず、shape成功からowner資格/意味一致を成立させない。"
      ],
      "unit_oracle_ref": "HELIXSECURITY-L8-001-VALIDATION"
    },
    {
      "id": "HELIXSECURITY-L5-001-F01",
      "symbol": "compare_untrusted_source",
      "signature": "compare_untrusted_source(input: F01Input, context: F01Context) -> ComparisonResult[F01Material]",
      "requirement_refs": [
        "HELIXSECURITY-L3-001-F01"
      ],
      "l4_ref": "HELIXSECURITY-L4-001-F01",
      "unit_oracle_ref": "HELIXSECURITY-L8-001-F01",
      "effect": "none",
      "algorithm": [
        "1. validate_boundary_inputでinput/contextの論理形を検査。invalidならmaterial=nullで全shape findingを返す。Stringの内容はtrim/coerce/defaultしない。shapeが正しくてもsource/target値の欠落/null/空文字はunknownで、public/別projectへ補わない。",
        "2. 独立target_project/target_revisionを比較する。未供給/null/空文字ならproject_missing/revision_missingをContext位置へ、供給targetと原sourceが異なればproject_mismatch/revision_mismatchをContext位置へ返す。inputとsource ownerが一致してもこの照合を省かない。",
